# File: scripts/__tests__/nmg-sdlc-smoke.test.mjs
# Generated from: specs/476-fix-smoke-candidate-identity-failing-on-a-checkout-that-gitignores-nmg-sdlc/requirements.md
Feature: Fix smoke candidate identity failing on a checkout that gitignores .nmg-sdlc

  @SCN001 @regression
  Scenario: A checkout that ignores .nmg-sdlc yields a candidate tree
    Given a git checkout whose .gitignore lists ".nmg-sdlc/" with a file under ".nmg-sdlc/" and a modified "plugin.mjs"
    When candidateTree runs
    Then the tree lists only ".gitignore" and "plugin.mjs" with the modified content

  @SCN002 @regression
  Scenario: A checkout that does not ignore .nmg-sdlc still leaves it out
    Given a git checkout without a ".nmg-sdlc/" ignore and with a file under ".nmg-sdlc/"
    When candidateTree runs
    Then the tree has no ".nmg-sdlc" entry
